  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral assistance to IDPs and host communities affected by conflict in north-west and southern Tigray and Amhara</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will implement both the SNFI and CCCM through direct implementation and implementing partners. 446 households (2,230 individuals) will be reached through IOM direct implementation, and the remaining will be reached through implementing partners in Southern and Northwest Tigray through shelter repair and reconstruction, providing a combination of in-kind assistance and cash support.</narrative>
  </description>
